  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span>The PAN (Permanent Account Number) is a vital document for citizens of India. Anyone who has applied for a PAN card can check the status of their application online via the official UTI or NSDL websites. These authorized PAN portals also provide services such as applying for a new PAN card, tracking application progress, making corrections, and updating PAN-related details. Access these services using the link provided below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">PAN Card Registration, Correction &amp; Other Service 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">PAN Card Registration, Correction &amp; Other Service 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>Already Start</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>Not Available</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Indian Citizen All Category :&nbsp;<strong>Rs.&nbsp;</strong><strong>107/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Indian Citizen Resident in Abroad Pan Card Registration Dispatched Fee :&nbsp;<strong>Rs.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>989/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>&nbsp;Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>What is the Pan Card </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">The Permanent Account Number (PAN) serves as an important identification document for taxpayers in India, making it necessary to keep all details accurate and current. This article explains the step-by-step process for updating or correcting PAN information using both online and offline options. It also covers the necessary forms, supporting documents, and applicable fees to ensure a smooth and hassle-free update process.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>How to Change PAN Card Details </b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Sometimes, mistakes can appear on a PAN card, such as errors in your name, parent’s name, or date of birth at the time of issuance. In other cases, details like your name or address may change later. In both situations, it is necessary to update your PAN card with the correct information, including your name, parent’s name, address, or date of birth. These updates can be made through either online or offline methods.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Document Required for Pan Card </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Aadhar Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Voter&nbsp;<span id=\"IL_AD3\" class=\"IL_AD\">Identify</span>&nbsp;Card (Voter ID)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Arms License</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Passport</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Driving License (DL)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pension Card with Photograph</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Ration Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span id=\"IL_AD5\" class=\"IL_AD\">Photo ID</span>&nbsp;Card Issued By Any Central / State Government Authority</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Any Other Related Supported Document</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How to Apply For New PAN Card</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Click on ”&nbsp;<strong>New PAN&nbsp;Card Registration</strong>” Tab to fill online Application form for New PAN card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Now Fill your PAN Card&nbsp;application form online&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Select your Required Documents which you have</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Click on Submit</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Verify your details and click on Proceed to&nbsp;<strong>Payment Button</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Make payment</strong>&nbsp;This is one time fee. No Hidden or extra cost.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>After successful Payment</strong>, download and print your pre-filled application form (along with Instruction sheet and Blank Application Form).</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Paste&nbsp;<strong>photo, sign, attach documents and post</strong>&nbsp;to address (You will get the postal address in instruction sheet.)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Now you will get your pan card to your address within 30 Days.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\"